      "provenance": "Pleiades",
      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Medyen</em>:\u00a0On the <em>\u1e24ic\u0101z</em>\u00a0(Hejaz) coast along the <em>Ba\u1e25r-i \u1e32ulz\u00fcm</em> (Red Sea) lies a ruined town from which the Prophet Shu\u02bfayb (peace be upon him) emerged. <em data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"494\">Medyen</em> was originally the name of the tribe settled there, and over time the town itself came to be called <em>Medyen</em>. [translation]</p>",
